{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a fresh take on this action adventure of\u00a0 &quot;Spirit X Strike,&quot; featuring three intertwined combat systems: Instant Counter, Super Strike, and Spirit Mimicry. Players can swiftly switch between defense and attack, and experience an adrenaline-pumping combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/216cecc4f2ce51e9a22ad24a6c0cbeb2.poster.avif?t=1763101279\" width=484 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/216cecc4f2ce51e9a22ad24a6c0cbeb2.webm?t=1763101279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/216cecc4f2ce51e9a22ad24a6c0cbeb2.mp4?t=1763101279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Action storing and release system to break the limits of COMBO potential!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together action sequences using the game\u2019s distinctive Spirit Mimicry. This system allows you to freely assemble moves and unleash them at the moment you desire. Even newcomers can easily execute stunning combos and air-juggle confirms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/3f5181b0f203cbd1fb30b10b25f797ff.poster.avif?t=1763101279\" width=484 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/3f5181b0f203cbd1fb30b10b25f797ff.webm?t=1763101279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/3f5181b0f203cbd1fb30b10b25f797ff.mp4?t=1763101279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s Strike Time!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break your opponents\u2019 defense with well-timed counters and quick pressure, then execute them with the finishing &quot;Super Strike&quot;. There are a lot of different \u201cSuper Strike\u201d finishers for different situations waiting for you to try out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/2f515c432e1785d18d291f51012bb8b7.poster.avif?t=1763101279\" width=484 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/2f515c432e1785d18d291f51012bb8b7.webm?t=1763101279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/2f515c432e1785d18d291f51012bb8b7.mp4?t=1763101279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in Post-Apocalyptic Wasteland</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Carter, the inheritor of the Spirit Fist, and face off against top warriors in the Wasteland. Unearth your limitless potential and &quot;Strike&quot; your way through!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/219a6ddbc23767d682183af14b8150df.poster.avif?t=1763101279\" width=484 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/219a6ddbc23767d682183af14b8150df.webm?t=1763101279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538880/extras/219a6ddbc23767d682183af14b8150df.mp4?t=1763101279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Super Strike","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2538880/1c4ec469c9cd56ec2477946911107e2faab81574.jpg"},{"name":"Spirit Dash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2538880/4963141714f3ac580a8b3f57c38e09e72708d75f.jpg"},{"name":"Instant Counter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2538880/7cfe2b4d1b141dbcf8068bf897b6b616bc1aa51a.jpg"},{"name":"Spirit Mimicry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2538880/79e88c171685c801ce0c989b297847cb0549be36.jpg"},{"name":"Hero's Come Back","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2538880/f447552590ca55e0132c890ccdead7004d708689.jpg"},{"name":"Head to the East","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2538880/ebb49bb511df59a6fe325b4f4ab2f3d6df96c4ca.jpg"},{"name":"Into the Stronghold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2538880/0c37dac44bce207c69a0ea0e9427b18d40e549d1.jpg"},{"name":"Dear Old Friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2538880/a73e840e4458e215d54a92e224cdf6ab8b0c0aaa.jpg"},{"name":"Master vs. Disciple","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2538880/a2b9b7d0ae25608240b4a0d00851763df5aa1f78.jpg"},{"name":"The Final Battle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2538880/11452d976707e45eedb81d3ba34840204d0b2e8c.jpg"}],"total":35},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2538880?t=1763101279","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepa